    kind: work_item  # a02a
    title: "INV-lupav residual: the L4 completeness signal is TEXTUAL, so an unaccounted use at a statement that does not name the variable (alias-shaped) is outside it — two probes do not reproduce, so this is a disclosed limit awaiting a sweep, not a defect"  # a02a
    status: todo_soft  # a02a
    priority: 3  # a02a
    parent:  # a02a
    tags:  # a02a
